  "description": "Following on from our previous application to replace our windows and install a door under application P/2026/1169 which was rejected due to the materials proposed (UPVC). We want to amend that application to just install the proposed door. We have reviewed the rejection letter P_2026_1169 and have changed the proposed materials for the door to Aluminium which is colour matched to the existing windows. The colour is white alluminium which is silver in colour and closest match to the current windows. Its also worth noting the window we want to turn into a door is at the back of the property, which is not visible from any street or public view. The reason for the proposed works is to allow for ground floor access for both our disabled parents, as well as ease of access so for our newborn baby of 4 months, to avoid two flights of stairs to access each time. ",
